    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire &amp; Convert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permanent allies or enemies\u2014only tactical value. Recruit, betray, and adapt your army to control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/50d8ffec93dca2c743ea5b864de921d4.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/50d8ffec93dca2c743ea5b864de921d4.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/50d8ffec93dca2c743ea5b864de921d4.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart Positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny move can change everything. Perfect your unit placement to control who fights whom and maximize their potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/262e61acd441f3ed0532e44938f51540.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/262e61acd441f3ed0532e44938f51540.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/262e61acd441f3ed0532e44938f51540.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kite, focus fire, and exploit synergies. Outsmart stronger foes by mastering unit strengths and battlefield positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/2ae8fbcfa3ec00f40a9de365bfe4111f.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/2ae8fbcfa3ec00f40a9de365bfe4111f.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/2ae8fbcfa3ec00f40a9de365bfe4111f.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Chess Puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test strategies, refine your approach, and watch your mercenaries fight\u2014if they\u2019ll listen to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/9dcf8aba77625af5c897ab05d6dd5be8.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/9dcf8aba77625af5c897ab05d6dd5be8.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/9dcf8aba77625af5c897ab05d6dd5be8.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Layouts, Endless Solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emergent puzzles in this game offer infinite potential\u2014every layout presents a fresh and thrilling challenge to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire &amp; Convert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permanent allies or enemies\u2014only tactical value. Recruit, betray, and adapt your army to control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/50d8ffec93dca2c743ea5b864de921d4.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/50d8ffec93dca2c743ea5b864de921d4.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/50d8ffec93dca2c743ea5b864de921d4.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart Positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny move can change everything. Perfect your unit placement to control who fights whom and maximize their potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/262e61acd441f3ed0532e44938f51540.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/262e61acd441f3ed0532e44938f51540.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/262e61acd441f3ed0532e44938f51540.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kite, focus fire, and exploit synergies. Outsmart stronger foes by mastering unit strengths and battlefield positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/2ae8fbcfa3ec00f40a9de365bfe4111f.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/2ae8fbcfa3ec00f40a9de365bfe4111f.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/2ae8fbcfa3ec00f40a9de365bfe4111f.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Chess Puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test strategies, refine your approach, and watch your mercenaries fight\u2014if they\u2019ll listen to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/9dcf8aba77625af5c897ab05d6dd5be8.poster.avif?t=1752908652\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/9dcf8aba77625af5c897ab05d6dd5be8.webm?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/9dcf8aba77625af5c897ab05d6dd5be8.mp4?t=1752908652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Layouts, Endless Solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emergent puzzles in this game offer infinite potential\u2014every layout presents a fresh and thrilling challenge to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
